|-
! Clock !! Derivation !! Fraction !! Decimal
|-
| '''X2''' || n/a || <math>\frac{250}{17}</math><ref>The MX8350 datasheet specifies an RCLK of 250 MHz and a multiplier of 17.</ref> || 14.7058823529
|-
| '''RCLK''' || X2 × 17 || <math>250</math> || 250
|-
| '''MClock''' || RCLK ÷ 4 || <math>\frac{125}{2}</math> || 62.5
|-
| '''[[VR4300|CPU]]''' || MClock × <math>\frac{3}{2}</math> || <math>\frac{375}{4}</math> || 93.75<ref>CPU clock multiplier set via [[VR4300]] DivMode (Divide Mode) static pin inputs. 93.75 MHz is the nominal operating frequency.</ref>
|-
| '''[[Serial Interface]]''' || MClock ÷ 4 || <math>\frac{125}{8}</math> || 15.625
